{"parse": {"title": "FR-18", "pageid": 40860, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FR-17\" title=\"FR-17\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FR-18</span><a href=\"/wiki/FR-19\" title=\"FR-19\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FR</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">18</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.BD.A0.E5.A5.BD.EF.BC.8C.E6.9D.A5.E4.BA.9A.E4.BB.80.E5.9F.BA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"你好，来亚什基\">你好，来亚什基</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 你好，来亚什基</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Hello, Rayashki</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>切<span class=\"color-value\"></span>都<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>改<span class=\"color-value\"></span>变<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1810118</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang2\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang2.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang2.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang2.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们又一次汇聚在了一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但值得庆幸的是，没有争端，没有怨愤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一场属于所有人的会议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>经过审慎的讨论，来亚什基全体居民都做出了最后的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>现在，我正式宣布关于来亚什基的处理方案——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>来亚什基从即日起不再附属于任何组织，关停所有卢恩矿石的相关工厂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-618801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-618801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-618801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">镇民Ⅰ：</div><div>那咱们能做些什么呢——？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-618701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-618701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-618701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">镇民Ⅱ：</div><div>我可不想闲在家里，每月巴巴地等着救济金。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>我们能做许多事，瓦列里娅同志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>绝大多数的能源被屈指可数的寡头们把持，他们利用战争、权力操控着属于普通人的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>而现在，至少人们多了一处新煤矿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>我们将在来亚什基开展新的工厂线，并积极探索与周边地区的煤炭工业的合作可能性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>我们可以依靠自己的双手，开采煤矿，发展效益。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">克努特：</div><div>没准、没准咱们还能建造船坞，把它们送到更遥远的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们七嘴八舌地议论了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>我们希望来亚什基能够成为一面新的旗帜——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>一个为更多的普通人们供给低价煤炭、发光发热的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无数热切的目光交织在一起，唤起如潮般的掌声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>潮水漫过了所有人，当然也包括北方哨歌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>那么你呢？北方哨歌同志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我打算暂时留在这儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>为了缩减成本，我们必须得作出短暂的牺牲……之后，所有人在来亚什基的待遇都会被削减，直到来亚什基步入新的轨道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但对方似乎丝毫没有动摇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>相比于光鲜亮丽的学术舞台，至少现在，理线学更适合呆在这儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>关于这儿环境的演变，地脉能量图的进一步完善，以及基基图克们的生物性变化……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>它们都是理线学亟待解决的重要课题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>听上去，你要在这儿呆上一段不短的时间。祝你成功。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两人相视一笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>也欢迎你来参观来亚什基新的剪彩仪式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这只热情的手又一次伸到了北方哨歌的面前。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang1\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang1.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang1.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang1.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>现在，这座漂亮的北极小镇被黑色的炭球与明黄色的花朵覆盖着，暖和的风途经每一寸土壤与砖墙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>像是雪白肌肤下流动的血液与蓬松的毛孔，又像是未经修磨的手绘图画。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-307713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-307713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-307713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌独自走在小镇上，她走得很慢，像是融入了这片土壤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>形形色色的人们从她的身旁经过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>点头，致意。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_tonghuaguangchang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_tonghuaguangchang2\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_tonghuaguangchang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-1_8_bg_tonghuaguangchang2.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_tonghuaguangchang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-1_8_bg_tonghuaguangchang2.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_tonghuaguangchang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-1_8_bg_tonghuaguangchang2.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_tonghuaguangchang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">彼得森：</div><div>北方哨歌老师——我为当时课堂上的无礼向您道歉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">彼得森：</div><div>下次我一定请您品尝最好的友谊牌奶酪，我保证！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">克努特：</div><div>你永远是咱们的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">克努特：</div><div>向你致敬～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远处，成群结队的孩子们簇拥着一位鲜艳的向日葵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>北方哨歌——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>我们的剪彩仪式表演得很好！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>向日葵朝她挥手，在雪地上蹦蹦跳跳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>你还会给我们上课吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">尼娜：</div><div>还有我们——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-618601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-618601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-618601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕索诺：</div><div>我也是！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>♪～♪♪～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>北方哨歌姐姐，我们种下的向日葵长出来了——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>我们成功地保护了小镇！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌想说些什么，突然的轰鸣声吸引了所有人的注意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抬起头来，巨大的起重机正低头俯瞰着这座小镇。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang1\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang1.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang1.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang1.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenguangchang1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>新的煤矿工厂，来亚什基小学，冰上曲棍球场，集体宿舍……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在来亚什基，或者说，在更广袤无垠的理想未来里，它们都像是粒粒斑驳的沙砾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>这儿有许多希望汇入其中的沙砾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>……我也一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>你好，来亚什基。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FR-18"}}